# Etali, Primal Conqueror: "each player exiles cards from the top of their library until they exile a nonland card" - when
# a library holds only lands the exiling goes on until it is empty, and nothing is found. Bot2's whole library is three
# Islands (it has not drawn yet), all exiled; Bot1's top card is a Lightning Bolt, found and cast for free at Bot2, which
# goes to 17 life. Bot1 pays for Etali with three Black Lotuses.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
